          "text": "For $\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathbf R$, if $\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{x^2\\sin\\alpha x+(\\gamma-1)e^{x^2}}{\\sin2x-\\beta x}=3$, then $\\beta+\\gamma-\\alpha$ is equal to:",
