          "solution": "$f''=f$ gives $f(x)=Ae^x+Be^{-x}$. $f(0)=0\\Rightarrow B=-A$; $f'(0)=A-B=2A=3\\Rightarrow A=\\frac32$.<br>$f(x)=\\frac32\\left(e^x-e^{-x}\\right)=3\\sinh x$ (odd, and $f'=3\\cosh x\\gt 0$, as required).<br>$f(\\ln3)=\\frac32\\left(3-\\frac13\\right)=4$, so $9f(\\ln3)=36$."
